{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A narrative-focused <strong>psychological horror</strong> game about <strong>possessed computers</strong>.\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708920/extras/office_warning.png?t=1747753125\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Place of Ruin and Misery</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the Red Newton Games office, an abandoned building where forgotten machines and grueling memmories formed an unholy bond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708920/extras/idle_computer.gif?t=1747753125\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Unveil another world</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You thought that building could lead you to your missing sister and that computer could have a carreer saving news story. All it had was a soul in agony and you set it free.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708920/extras/Captura_de_Tela__130_.png?t=1747753125\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What to expect from this demo?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo encompasses the first act of the game with around 30 minutes of gameplay allowing the player to explore most of the game's first area and a special area. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Available in both english and portuguese.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the Red Newton Games office! Are you ready for a tour around our first floor? </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy the city air on our beautiful parking lot!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet our welcoming commitee at the reception!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Operate one of our state of the art computers!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take a stroll down memory lane with one of our estimated employees!\u00a0</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3708920?t=1747753125","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3708920?t=1747753125","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708920/fa45557b5b12ffa1ed4beaa00d032527b6709bae/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747753125","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708920/fa45557b5b12ffa1ed4beaa00d032527b6709bae/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747753125","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A narrative-focused <strong>psychological horror</strong> game about <strong>possessed computers</strong>.\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708920/extras/office_warning.png?t=1747753125\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Place of Ruin and Misery</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the Red Newton Games office, an abandoned building where forgotten machines and grueling memmories formed an unholy bond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708920/extras/idle_computer.gif?t=1747753125\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Unveil another world</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You thought that building could lead you to your missing sister and that computer could have a carreer saving news story. All it had was a soul in agony and you set it free.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img clas